---
description: Rules for AI generation — prompt management, streaming, and structured output shape
globs: ["src/lib/claude.ts", "src/lib/prompts.ts", "src/app/api/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- All prompt strings live in `src/lib/prompts.ts` only — never inline in routes or components.
- Use `stream: true` on every Claude call — required to avoid Vercel/Edge timeouts on long responses.
- Claude must return structured JSON with exactly these keys: `scope`, `timeline`, `quote`, `contract`, `questions`.
- Each section must be independently renderable and editable in the UI — no monolithic blobs.
- Do not hardcode model strings outside `src/lib/claude.ts`. Default model: `claude-opus-4-8`.
- Validate that PDF text is non-empty and ≥ 100 characters before calling Claude; return a clear user-facing error if not.
